But it's much more likely that these were generated from a mass
polypiling session.  Items retain some information about how many
times they've been polymorphed.  The more times you polymorph an item,
the higher its recharge count is set upon generation.  The max
recharge count for a marker is one, so most markers you get from
polypiling are (1:xx).

